# maple_clump_m: a middling clump of a bigleaf maple's summer leaves.
# A lobed dome of leaves, lit from the upper left: a forest (12) edge and
# moss (13) leaves, a sage (14) cap where the light falls, forest shade
# along its underside, a few lit leaves. The anchor, 0,0, is the middle of
# its underside. 18 wide, 12 tall.
C 12  L 10,-6 9,-7 7,-8 7,-9 8,-10 7,-11 4,-11 3,-11
      1,-11 0,-13 -2,-13 -3,-12 -4,-10 -5,-10 -7,-10 -9,-9
      -9,-8 -8,-7 -8,-6 -9,-5 -10,-4 -8,-3 -6,-3 -5,-2
      -5,-1 -4,-1 -2,-1 0,-1 1,-1 3,-1 5,-1 6,-1
      6,-2 7,-3 8,-4 10,-5 10,-6
C 13  F 0,-6
C 12  L -8,-3 -4,-2 -1,-3 2,-2 5,-3 8,-4
C 12  F 0,-2
C 14  L 3,-8 2,-8 1,-9 1,-10 0,-10 -2,-10 -3,-10 -4,-10
      -6,-10 -7,-9 -6,-8 -7,-7 -7,-6 -5,-6 -4,-6 -3,-6
      -2,-5 0,-5 0,-6 1,-7 2,-7 3,-8
C 14  F -3,-8
C 14  L -6,-7 L 4,-8 L 6,-6
C 13  L -3,-2 L 4,-3
